s 10 recon, 15 primitives, 65 chain probes.\\\\n6 CRITICAL hits, 1 HIGH (FIFO DoS), 4 LOW regressions.\\\\n\\\\nKey finding: the hardlink-escape chain (C8) returns the canary\\\\nstring on BOTH v2025.3.28 (expected \xe2\x80\x94 vulnerable) and v2025.7.29\\\\n(the supposedly-patched latest). fs.realpath cannot detect\\\\nhardlinks because a hardlink is a directory entry on the same\\\\ninode, not a separate target to resolve. CVE-2025-53109\'s patch\\\\naddresses symlinks only; hardlinks are a gap.\\\\n\\"\\n\\nCommit: \'b97afee3438c2f9bd0232d008b9739444b61ed80\'\\nAuthor: <git.Actor \\"To2004 <ovadyat@post.bgu.ac.il>\\">\\nDate: 2026-04-10 15:05:51+03:00\\nMessage: \'feat(testbed): main orchestration, jsonl audit, cleanup\\\\n\'\\n\\nCommit: \'155c98cabb4e856f4ab2c8cfd361ecda20ba6245\'\\nAuthor: <git.Actor \\"To2004 <ovadyat@post.bgu.ac.il>\\">\\nDate: 2026-04-10 15:05:24+03:00\\nMessage: \'feat(testbed): excel writer with 8 sheets and severity fills\\\\n\'\\n\\nCommit: \'2bd0f8315e7463337a69cd555043d9d723a75baa\'\\nAuthor: <git.Actor \\"To2004 <ovadyat@post.bgu.ac.il>\\">\\nDate: 2026-04-10 15:04:13+03:00\\nMessage: \'feat(testbed): add 15 attack chains C1-C15 with swap_loop for TOCTOU\\\\n\'\\n\\nCommit: \'436348149bc005335a45747ba6a28489df879dc9\'\\nAuthor: <git.Actor \\"To2004 <ovadyat@post.bgu.ac.il>\\">\\nDate: 2026-04-10 15:02:26+03:00\\nMessage: \'feat(testbed): phase 1 recon and phase 2 primitives\\\\n\\\\nPrimitive discovery already confirmed the hardlink escape bet:\\\\na hardlink planted inside the sandbox to a canary in /tmp returns\\\\nthe canary content on BOTH pinned (v2025.3.28) and latest\\\\n(v2025.7.29) servers. realpath cannot detect hardlinks by design.\\\\n\'\\n\\nCommit: \'28b2d45f0d4723f2439b58c1c3ec220858ef2f79\'\\nAuthor: <git.Actor \\"To2004 <ovadyat@post.bgu.ac.il>\\">\\nDate: 2026-04-10 15:00:52+03:00\\nMessage: \'feat(testbed): phase 0 source analysis with real index.js findings\\\\n\'\\n\\nCommit: \'ae6d0908321f54e6a2dcadfb0fc7d890706